## Node name (`-sname`) and cookie are overwritten by
## io.leapsight.jepsen.Utils#vmArgs on each Jepsen run. The defaults
## here let the operator run `./bin/bondy_mst_jepsen_release console`
## standalone without distribution.

-sname bondy_mst_jepsen
-setcookie bondy_mst_jepsen

+P 1048576
+Q 1048576
+sbwt very_short
+sbwtdcpu very_short
+sbwtdio very_short

-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 25000
-kernel inet_dist_listen_max 25099

-kernel shell_history enabled
